-37-54.png", "id": "2011053693032242", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307422_2011053696365575_6911773548344987741_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bEUCEJLF9gsQ7kNvwE2kiB7&_nc_oc=AdoCNM3py8oZWFRhN3rYuDhpFlmMve3NfItdVABKmQIrIgy1VeHTxvmlvLg_73jQc74&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4LmHod8Z5-_WTsny59--ABzyx7iy9DMPiChBcX6pRhtQ&oe=6A11BB2B"}, {"file_name": "SampleScene_1440p_15.08.2025_17-41-06.png", "id": "1503494934145983", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304106_1503494937479316_914509454795836257_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SF44MZjTiR8Q7kNvwGcfDLw&_nc_oc=AdroNq0twMewX68zILiLGwkIrS4-zWkyd5_HNUPWk44drNRHxmhA_oAr31j6wh9ZAUE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6Rmaw_eVf215Y0HpKDB5fCnQgDAryxlbO4ohu6jY26gw&oe=6A1198EC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ape Complex", "keywords": ["Ape", "Lethal", "Gorilla", "Animal", "Scary"], "long_description": "Welcome to Ape Complex,\n\n where you, a somehow talking ape ( dont ask, just accept it ), find yourself trapped in the world\u2019s most depressing concrete hallway simulator. Yes, the interior design is 99% grey walls and flickering fluorescent lights, perfect for setting the mood of \u201cI want to escape, but also maybe cry.\u201d\n\nBut wait\u2014this isn\u2019t just a walking tour of OSHA violations. Lurking in the corridors is Sandman, a lanky, nightmare-fuel monster who struts around on two legs like he owns the place. \nYour job? \nSurvive.. or sum idrk lol.\nSo grab your courage (and maybe a banana or two) and prepare to sprint, scream, and slip into madness. After all, nothing says \u201cfun evening\u201d quite like being an ape hunted by a man-shaped nightmare in a warehouse basement.\n\nGAME BY: BRAINBYTEMEDIA", "short_description": "Welcome to Ape Complex, where you, a somehow talking ape ( dont ask, just accept i